    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but there isn't a \"different way.\" that's the thing. it's not a plateau, it's just an end. i look at my old work and then i look at what i'm doing now and it's embarrassing. it's like i'm a ghost of myself. if i keep going, i'm just going to keep making garbage until i'm nothing. i'd rather just stop now while i'm still 'something' than live to see myself become a joke.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
